$( <MM> <PROOF_ASST> THEOREM=extrwins  LOC_AFTER=?

* The five inputs of the extraction loop at fixed scales: the modulus is at least 2, N* >= 1, every pool element is a prime at most x coprime to L, the pool supplies the rounds, and every N*-subset of the pool has a nonempty subset with product 1 modulo L (Lean: extraction_inputsW, with the round-count comparison as a hypothesis).

